# API Rules


## REST API


Use REST principles.


Version:


/api/v1


## Every Endpoint Requires


- Authentication
- Authorization
- Validation
- Documentation


## Swagger


All endpoints must be documented using:

OpenAPI 3.1

Swagger UI

rswag


Documentation includes:

- parameters
- request schema
- response schema
- errors
- authentication


## Responses


Always provide:

success responses

error responses


Use correct HTTP status codes.


## Pagination


All list endpoints require pagination.


Support:

- filtering
- sorting
- searching


## Errors


Use consistent format.


Example:


{
 error:
 {
   code:"",
   message:"",
   details:[]
 }
}